.DS_Store
.claude/
**/.claude/taste-signals.jsonl
**/.claude/taste-watch/

# The user's global excludes (~/.config/git/ignore) drop SUMMARY.md and HANDOFF.md.
# SUMMARY.md is a required deliverable here — a hub whose own source map is untracked
# is not a source of truth. Re-include it explicitly; a negation in a repo .gitignore
# overrides the global file. HANDOFF.md is deliberately local-only (untracked, kept on
# disk), so the global exclusion is left in place for it.
!SUMMARY.md
!**/SUMMARY.md
